WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A golden vortex spirals open inside Lunatic Pandora. Time compression begins.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A vast organic form descends through pale clouds, its surface rippling with patterns.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Objects and figures tumble through an endless teal void, weightless and scattered.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Reality melts. Reflective blobs drift through empty space, warping everything they touch.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Bright blue ocean stretches in every direction, sunlight piercing the water's surface.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Underwater, schools of tropical fish swirl around rocky formations in deep blue water.

7
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000
A pillar of white energy erupts through a burning orange sky.

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Thousands of birds scatter across a pink sky in a churning, frantic mass.

9
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:22.000
A blinding burst of particles radiates outward. Time compression takes hold.
